    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SEA OF BEASTS is a CHAOTIC LOCAL multiplayer action game for 1-4 players. TEAM UP or COMPETE as little penguins while surviving the ferocious beasts of the sea! SURVIVE MONSTERS, CONQUER FLAGS, and UNLEACH CHAOS!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The more, the merrier!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with your friends <strong>locally or remotely</strong> with <strong>Steam Remote Play Together!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766340/extras/5b17a7718ccb74c6b4f08f13a89788bb.poster.avif?t=1755095121\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766340/extras/5b17a7718ccb74c6b4f08f13a89788bb.webm?t=1755095121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766340/extras/5b17a7718ccb74c6b4f08f13a89788bb.mp4?t=1755095121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Huge Bosses!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against a <strong>rage of monsters</strong> like <strong>Krakens, Genies, Hydras, and more!<br> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766340/extras/7baeca2351a9dc03fb4fa5dd3acf24f1.poster.avif?t=1755095121\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766340/extras/7baeca2351a9dc03fb4fa5dd3acf24f1.webm?t=1755095121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766340/extras/7baeca2351a9dc03fb4fa5dd3acf24f1.mp4?t=1755095121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766340/extras/e93eb3b8443101743578622e859233a1.poster.avif?t=1755095121\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766340/extras/e93eb3b8443101743578622e859233a1.webm?t=1755095121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766340/extras/e93eb3b8443101743578622e859233a1.mp4?t=1755095121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dash into multiple game modes!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a raft, capture flags, conquer zones... There's plenty of content to keep your friends busy!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766340/extras/4542078d9ac9c404c23c78535a4a4112.poster.avif?t=1755095121\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766340/extras/4542078d9ac9c404c23c78535a4a4112.webm?t=1755095121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766340/extras/4542078d9ac9c404c23c78535a4a4112.mp4?t=1755095121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83e\udd96<strong>Ferocious Beasts!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>4-Player Local Multiplayer + Steam Remote Play Together support!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Multiple Maps and Game Modes!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc27 <strong>Cute Penguins!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Custom Rules!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SEA OF BEASTS is a CHAOTIC LOCAL multiplayer action game for 1-4 players. TEAM UP or COMPETE as little penguins while surviving the ferocious beasts of the sea! SURVIVE MONSTERS, CONQUER FLAGS, and UNLEACH CHAOS!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The more, the merrier!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with your friends <strong>locally or remotely</strong> with <strong>Steam Remote Play Together!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766340/extras/5b17a7718ccb74c6b4f08f13a89788bb.poster.avif?t=1755095121\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766340/extras/5b17a7718ccb74c6b4f08f13a89788bb.webm?t=1755095121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766340/extras/5b17a7718ccb74c6b4f08f13a89788bb.mp4?t=1755095121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Huge Bosses!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against a <strong>rage of monsters</strong> like <strong>Krakens, Genies, Hydras, and more!<br> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766340/extras/7baeca2351a9dc03fb4fa5dd3acf24f1.poster.avif?t=1755095121\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766340/extras/7baeca2351a9dc03fb4fa5dd3acf24f1.webm?t=1755095121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766340/extras/7baeca2351a9dc03fb4fa5dd3acf24f1.mp4?t=1755095121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766340/extras/e93eb3b8443101743578622e859233a1.poster.avif?t=1755095121\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766340/extras/e93eb3b8443101743578622e859233a1.webm?t=1755095121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766340/extras/e93eb3b8443101743578622e859233a1.mp4?t=1755095121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dash into multiple game modes!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a raft, capture flags, conquer zones... There's plenty of content to keep your friends busy!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766340/extras/4542078d9ac9c404c23c78535a4a4112.poster.avif?t=1755095121\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766340/extras/4542078d9ac9c404c23c78535a4a4112.webm?t=1755095121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766340/extras/4542078d9ac9c404c23c78535a4a4112.mp4?t=1755095121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83e\udd96<strong>Ferocious Beasts!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>4-Player Local Multiplayer + Steam Remote Play Together support!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Multiple Maps and Game Modes!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc27 <strong>Cute Penguins!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Custom Rules!</strong></p>",
